<title>GREECE: Greece to float further 10.7 of state telecom OTE.</title>
<headline>Greece to float further 10.7 of state telecom OTE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's socialist government will float a further 10.7 percent of its state telecom OTE, government spokesman Dimitris Reppas told reporters.</p>
<p>&quot;The flotation of 10.7 percent (of OTE) was decided,&quot; he told reporters after a cabinet meeting.</p>
</text>
